# ◈ DataLens

### CSV Analysis Dashboard

**DataLens** is a lightweight, privacy-first CSV analysis dashboard that runs entirely in your browser. Upload a CSV file and instantly explore statistics, data-quality warnings, interactive SVG charts, searchable and sortable tables, and intelligent insights through a polished glassmorphic interface. **No server, no data sharing, just instant analytics.** ⚡ **Core Capabilities:** Drag-and-drop CSV parsing with quoted fields and comma-separated data, automatic statistics including row count, missing values, duplicates and column types, data-quality warnings for high-null columns, constant columns and potential unique IDs, interactive Bar, Line, Pie and Scatter charts rendered using SVG, global search, per-column filters, sortable tables, a custom chart builder with X/Y axis selection, CSV export of visible or filtered data, multiple dataset support with tabbed switching, and persistent Dark/Light theme preferences using `localStorage`. 🧩 **Technology Stack:** HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla JavaScript, SVG and localStorage. **No frameworks, no backend, no dependencies and no build process.** 🚀 **Quick Start:** Open `index.html` → drag and drop a CSV file → explore your data. 📊 **Visualization:** DataLens automatically recommends useful visualizations including Bar Charts for comparisons, Line Charts for trends, Pie Charts for distributions and Scatter Plots for relationships between numerical variables. A Custom Chart Builder also allows users to manually select X and Y axes. 🔍 **Data Quality:** Automatically detects missing values, constant-value columns, potential unique identifiers, duplicate records and column types. 🔎 **Data Exploration:** Search the complete dataset, filter individual columns, sort records and export visible or filtered data as CSV. ⌨️ **Keyboard Shortcuts:** `Ctrl + K` / `⌘ + K` to focus search and `ESC` to close modals. 🔐 **Privacy First:** Your CSV is processed entirely inside the browser. There is no backend server, database, file-upload API, external data sharing or account requirement. 💾 **Multiple Datasets:** Load multiple datasets and switch between them using tabs without uploading data to a server. 🎨 **UI:** Modern glassmorphic analytics interface with dark-first design, neon accents, responsive layout, smooth interactions and Dark/Light theme support. 📁 **Project Structure:** `index.html` · `style.css` · `script.js` · `README.md`. 🛠️ **Run Locally:** Simply open `index.html` in your browser — no installation or build process required. 🌟 **Why DataLens?** Most CSV viewers simply display rows and columns; **DataLens turns a CSV file into an interactive analytical workspace**, helping users quickly understand dataset size, missing values, duplicates, column types, patterns and relationships, while allowing them to search, filter and export data. 📌 **Highlights:** `⚡ Zero Dependencies` · `🔒 Privacy First` · `📊 Interactive Analytics` · `📈 SVG Charts` · `🔎 Powerful Search` · `🧹 Data Quality Checks` · `📁 Multiple Datasets` · `🌓 Dark / Light Theme` · `📱 Responsive` · `🚀 No Build Required`. 📜 **License:** MIT License · 2026. `#csv` `#analytics` `#datavisualization` `#vanillajs` `#javascript` `#html5` `#css3` `#svg` `#frontend`
